<h2>Why it wins jobs</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Exact match to the room.</strong> The client's designer picks the wall color; the cabinets come in the same Sherwin-Williams number.</li>
  <li><strong>Fewer lost jobs to local custom shops.</strong> Custom color without leaving a production line you already know how to order.</li>
  <li><strong>Approved before it's built.</strong> The sample door and approval form mean no surprises at install.</li>
</ul>

<p>See our <a href="/playbook/custom-paint-sherwin-williams/">original Custom Paint overview</a> for the background on the program.</p>

